#: src/splent_io/splent_feature_marketplace/templates/marketplace/publish.html:4
#: src/splent_io/splent_feature_marketplace/templates/marketplace/publish.html:9
msgid "Publish your feature"
msgstr "Publica tu feature"

#: src/splent_io/splent_feature_marketplace/templates/marketplace/publish.html:10
msgid ""
"There is no upload button, and that is the point. Releasing on your own "
"GitHub is publishing, and the marketplace index is rebuilt from your "
"feature's contract."
msgstr ""
"No hay botón de subida, y esa es la idea. Publicar una versión en tu "
"propio GitHub ya es publicar, y el índice del marketplace se reconstruye "
"a partir del contrato de tu feature."

#: src/splent_io/splent_feature_marketplace/templates/marketplace/publish.html:24
msgid "Build your feature"
msgstr "Construye tu feature"

#: src/splent_io/splent_feature_marketplace/templates/marketplace/publish.html:25
msgid ""
"Scaffold it in your SPLENT workspace. The contract (what it provides and "
"what it requires) is inferred from the code and kept in the feature's own"
" pyproject.toml. You never write index data by hand."
msgstr ""
"Créala con el andamiaje de tu workspace de SPLENT. El contrato (qué "
"aporta y qué necesita) se deduce del código y se guarda en el "
"pyproject.toml de la propia feature. Nunca escribes a mano los datos del "
"índice."

#: src/splent_io/splent_feature_marketplace/templates/marketplace/publish.html:36
msgid "Release it"
msgstr "Publica una versión"

#: src/splent_io/splent_feature_marketplace/templates/marketplace/publish.html:37
msgid ""
"One command bumps the version, regenerates the contract, tags the "
"repository and uploads to PyPI. The Git tag IS the publication. There is "
"no separate submission step."
msgstr ""
"Un solo comando sube la versión, regenera el contrato, etiqueta el "
"repositorio y lo publica en PyPI. La etiqueta de Git ES la publicación. "
"No hay un paso de envío aparte."

#: src/splent_io/splent_feature_marketplace/templates/marketplace/publish.html:48
msgid "Get listed"
msgstr "Entra en el índice"

#: src/splent_io/splent_feature_marketplace/templates/marketplace/publish.html:49
msgid ""
"Open a pull request adding your GitHub organisation or repository to the "
"registry file of the index. Once reviewed and merged, the indexer reads "
"your released tags. You never push data into the marketplace."
msgstr ""
"Abre una pull request para añadir tu organización o tu repositorio de "
"GitHub al fichero de registro del índice. Una vez revisada y fusionada, "
"el indexador lee tus etiquetas publicadas. Nunca envías datos al "
"marketplace."

#: src/splent_io/splent_feature_marketplace/templates/marketplace/publish.html:59
msgid "You are in"
msgstr "Ya estás dentro"

#: src/splent_io/splent_feature_marketplace/templates/marketplace/publish.html:60
msgid ""
"The index rebuilds automatically from the latest released tags. Your "
"feature appears here with its contract, dependencies and collisions. To "
"fix or update anything, just release again."
msgstr ""
"El índice se reconstruye solo a partir de las últimas etiquetas "
"publicadas. Tu feature aparece aquí con su contrato, sus dependencias y "
"sus colisiones. Para corregir o actualizar cualquier cosa, publica otra "
"versión."

#: src/splent_io/splent_feature_marketplace/templates/marketplace/publish.html:62
msgid "Browse the catalog"
msgstr "Ver el catálogo"

#: src/splent_io/splent_feature_marketplace/templates/marketplace/publish.html:72
msgid "Accounts"
msgstr "Cuentas"

#: src/splent_io/splent_feature_marketplace/templates/marketplace/publish.html:73
msgid "None needed"
msgstr "No hace falta ninguna"

#: src/splent_io/splent_feature_marketplace/templates/marketplace/publish.html:76
msgid "Upload API"
msgstr "API de subida"

#: src/splent_io/splent_feature_marketplace/templates/marketplace/publish.html:77
msgid "Does not exist"
msgstr "No existe"

#: src/splent_io/splent_feature_marketplace/templates/marketplace/publish.html:80
msgid "Source of truth"
msgstr "Fuente de verdad"

#: src/splent_io/splent_feature_marketplace/templates/marketplace/publish.html:84
msgid "The index"
msgstr "El índice"

#: src/splent_io/splent_feature_marketplace/templates/marketplace/publish.html:85
msgid "A regenerable cache"
msgstr "Una caché que se puede regenerar"

#: src/splent_io/splent_feature_marketplace/templates/marketplace/publish.html:90
msgid "Why no upload?"
msgstr "¿Por qué no hay subida?"

#: src/splent_io/splent_feature_marketplace/templates/marketplace/publish.html:91
msgid ""
"Anything uploaded can drift from the code it describes. Here the index is"
" derived from released tags, so it can always be thrown away and rebuilt."
" It is never a second source of truth."
msgstr ""
"Todo lo que se sube puede acabar separándose del código que describe. "
"Aquí el índice se deriva de las etiquetas publicadas, así que siempre se "
"puede tirar y reconstruir. Nunca es una segunda fuente de verdad."

#: src/splent_io/splent_feature_marketplace/templates/marketplace/publish.html:93
msgid "Read the full publishing guide"
msgstr "Leer la guía completa de publicación"

#: src/splent_io/splent_feature_marketplace/templates/marketplace/spls.html:4
#: src/splent_io/splent_feature_marketplace/templates/marketplace/spls.html:9
msgid "Product lines"
msgstr "Líneas de producto"

#: src/splent_io/splent_feature_marketplace/templates/marketplace/spls.html:10
msgid ""
"Each line is a Software Product Line, a variability model over "
"marketplace features. Pick one and configure your own product."
msgstr ""
"Cada línea es una Línea de Producto Software, un modelo de variabilidad "
"sobre las features del marketplace. Elige una y configura tu propio "
"producto."

#: src/splent_io/splent_feature_marketplace/templates/marketplace/spls.html:31
msgid "Configure this line"
msgstr "Configurar esta línea"

#: src/splent_io/splent_feature_marketplace/templates/marketplace/spls.html:40
msgid "Always included"
msgstr "Siempre incluidas"

#: src/splent_io/splent_feature_marketplace/templates/marketplace/spls.html:55
msgid "choose exactly one"
msgstr "elige una y solo una"

#: src/splent_io/splent_feature_marketplace/templates/marketplace/spls.html:69
msgid "Optional"
msgstr "Opcionales"

#: src/splent_io/splent_feature_marketplace/templates/marketplace/spls.html:84
msgid "No product lines in the index yet."
msgstr "Todavía no hay líneas de producto en el índice."

